  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Data and code from: Coordinated distributed experiments in ecology do not consistently reduce heterogeneity in effect size (2024) in Dryad. 11 download(s) recorded.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Data and code from: Coordinated distributed experiments in ecology do not consistently reduce heterogeneity in effect size (2024) in Dryad is authored by Bebout, Julia and Fox, Jeremy. Topics: Pairwise comparison, Study heterogeneity, Variance (accounting), Spatial heterogeneity and Statistics.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">1 citations (OpenAlex). Citing venues include Oikos.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
